ga0H(){return"\u2022 Multi-VCS: Azure DevOps, GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket\n\u2022 AI providers: Google Gemini and OpenAI\n\u2022 Side-by-side diff, draft comments and configurable tech stack\n\u2022 Built with Kotlin Multiplatform for macOS, Windows and Linux"},
